// # 2026-09-11 Math Correctness Sweep — science/chem
//
// Logline: Numerical-correctness audit of the std chemistry domain
//          (17 .oo files, 1982 lines total). Spot-checked each
//          file's core formula against textbook references;
//          documented sign conventions, edge-case handling, and
//          fp64-vs-fp32 mixing. No host-executed probes (math
//          probes would require oodac emit-llvm which is broken
//          per the 2026-09-11 polyrepo sweep — muse's lane).
//
// Setup:  Authored 2026-09-11 by Mavis. First sub-phase of the
//         Round F math sweep (5 sub-phases: bio/chem/comm/econ/
//         phys). Closes perf-sweep note n1 from the polyrepo
//         rollup. Method: per-file read + spot-check formulas
//         against textbook refs (Arrhenius 1889, Nernst 1889,
//         Raoult 1887, Debye-Hückel 1923, etc.).
//
// Beats:
//   1. Per-file verdict.
//   2. Method + scope.
//   3. Findings by severity.
//   4. Recommended probes.
//   5. Cross-references.

// ## 1. Per-file verdict

