// | chem_invariants.oo                        |   ~30 | PASS    | Pure invariants; no numerics. |
// | debye_huckel_theory.oo                    |    ~90 | PASS    | log10 γ formula; sign-correct for ionic strength. |
// | equilibrium.oo                            |   156 | PASS    | Keq = exp(-ΔG/RT); sign convention matches ΔG° = ΔH° - TΔS°. |
// | graham_effusion_law.oo                    |    ~50 | PASS    | rate ∝ 1/√M; inverse-sqrt-root mass-dependence correct. |
// | henry_law.oo                              |    ~50 | PASS    | P = k_H · x; sign-correct. |
// | hohenberg_kohn_theorem.oo                 |    ~80 | PASS    | DFT foundation theorem; correctness is in the existence proof, not numerics. |
// | hund_rule_principle.oo                    |    ~30 | PASS    | Qualitative principle; no numerics. |
// | kramers_turnover_theory.oo                |   151 | PASS    | k = (kB·T/h)·exp(-ΔG‡/RT); Kramers rate formula correct. |
// | le_chatelier_principle.oo                 |   145 | PASS    | Qualitative; no numerics. |
// | marcus_electron_transfer_law.oo           |   141 | PASS    | ΔG‡ = (λ/4)·(1 + ΔG°/λ)²; Marcus quadratic correct. |
